bstacles and reach new heights with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/JumpSkillGif.gif?t=1743613994\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Glider Mechanic </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Start with a glider to descend safely from heights.<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Position yourself at strategic points to plan your route.<br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Collect small stone pieces scattered across the map to recharge your glider.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/extras/GliderSkillGif.gif?t=1743613994\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Epic Quest </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Gather larger stone fragments serving as checkpoints. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Overcome diverse parkour challenges. <br>    </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Restore the ancient Harmony Stone to bring balance back to the city. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leaderboard</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Achieve the highest rank globally, either solo or as a team, by restoring the city's peace the fastest.</p>","developers":["Thornwood Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123610/header.jpg?t=1743613994","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117729,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/25